{"reviews":[{"id":"B07BSMFXZN-0","r":5.0,"t":"Let me feel like a woman again! Thank you lobe wonder","x":"I\u2019d be lost or need plastic surgery without lobe wonders! I haven\u2019t been able to find the brand in stores since Claire\u2019s shut down, my earrings were pulled out years ago and I never thought I\u2019d be able to wear earrings again, lobe wonders are durable long lasting and reliable. However I recommend if wearing a heavy earring use two of the lobe wonders, I only were one as I normally only wear diamond studs but if I must were dangling earrings I use two. Also, even if you don\u2019t have a situation whe","h":12,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B07BSMFXZN-1","r":5.0,"t":"Awesome","x":"I LOVE THESE!!!! When I was in Jr. High (over 40 years ago) I had the hole in my pierced ear ripped & over the years it has gotten increasingly worse. I could never where stud earrings or small earrings because they would literally go through the hole in my ear until I discovered these about 6 years ago & I have used them ever since.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2015"},{"id":"B07BSMFXZN-2","r":5.0,"t":"LOVE TO WEAR MY BIG EARRINGS","x":"LOVE TO WEAR MY BIG EARRINGS ,THEY KEEP THE EARRING FROM STRETCHING THE EAR. IF EAR IS SPLIT THEY MAKE THEM  APPEAR NOT .JUST LIKE ADVERTISE.THE 2 PACK WAS A GOOD BUY ALSO.GOT 2 PACKS FOR THE PRICE OF ONE. LOVE THEM , WILL BE ORDERING MORE.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2015"},{"id":"B07BSMFXZN-3","r":4.0,"t":"Works like magic","x":"I was caught off guard when I received these because they are literally stickers for the backs of your ears, so I thought to myself, how could this possible work? Well they do! Super discreet. No bulky earring backs & stays in place","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2022"},{"id":"B07BSMFXZN-4","r":5.0,"t":"really works","x":"i knew about these lobe wonders for a long time but forgot the name of them and one day on amazon i found them and of course i ordered them i have a split ear but its not fully split i can still wear earrings but if the earring to heavy it hurts my ears so what i decided to do was order the lobe wonder and indeed it worked wonders i was happy you could not see the split in my ear or anything im very happy and will continue to buy this product very happy customer oh and it came on time to.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2013"},{"id":"B07BSMFXZN-5","r":5.0,"t":"Love these!!!","x":"I have a torn earlobe ( torn all the way to the end) I wouldn't be able to wear earrings without these! If you clean the back of your earlobe with rubbing alcohol beforehand it will make these stay on for about a week, maybe two. Love this product!!!!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"May 2022"},{"id":"B07BSMFXZN-6","r":4.0,"t":"these are the best","x":"I have used lobe wonders for years.work so much better than other brands.if you need these buy lobewonder","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2015"},{"id":"B07BSMFXZN-7","r":5.0,"t":"Wonderful for your aching ears","x":"Such an easy solution n it's so convenient now  to wear heavy / long earings for hours together.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2016"},{"id":"B07BSMFXZN-8","r":5.0,"t":"It works!","x":"Now that I am older, when I wear my post earrings they droop. Just received a beautiful pair of earrings and wanted them to look nice so I bought this product. No more droopy earrings. I have been wearing the same adhesive now for 5 days and they are still sticking even after showers and baths! Highly recommend this product.","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Mar 2014"},{"id":"B07BSMFXZN-9","r":5.0,"t":"A MUST HAVE","x":"I have a torn ear lobe from wearing large earrings.  Also I have stretched other holes in my ears.  THIS PRODUCT HAS ALLOWED ME TO WEAR EARRINGS AGAIN.  I WILL ALWAYS KEERP THIS PRODUCT IN MY JEWELRY BIX!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"},{"id":"B07BSMFXZN-10","r":2.0,"t":"it does not work for big earrings","x":"it does not work for big earrings as in the pisture it shows small earrings.tried two still did not work.stuck with the was te of money don't pay to ship back,glad I bought the smaller package.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2013"},{"id":"B07BSMFXZN-11","r":2.0,"t":"Super disappointing","x":"These are nothing but sticky, tacky stickers that don't help keep earrings from weighing down my stretched earring holes. They also leave an annoying tacky residue that gets stuck in my hair.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2014"},{"id":"B07BSMFXZN-12","r":2.0,"t":"Not as good as I thought...","x":"They aren't as sturdy as I thought, they move as the day goes by and cause my extended hole to show. My light studs they work fine, but my heavier ones they stink.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2014"},{"id":"B07BSMFXZN-13","r":5.0,"t":"Great Product!","x":"Perfect for a torn earlobe. I am now able to wear my favorite earrings without fear of losing one or having one hang down low.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2016"},{"id":"B07BSMFXZN-14","r":5.0,"t":"Wonderful. I can wear dangle earrings again","x":"Wonderful.  I can wear dangle earrings again.  These stay on for several days even with a tender wash to the earlobe .","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2018"},{"id":"B07BSMFXZN-15","r":5.0,"t":"lobe wonder","x":"Eccessed my expectations I can wear my earrings again and they don't hang down towards the floor.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B07BSMFXZN-16","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Love these. I can finally wear heavier/larger  earrings with out my lobes being stretched.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B07BSMFXZN-17","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Great product. Surprisingly they stay put until you take them off. Very impressed.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2016"},{"id":"B07BSMFXZN-18","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"These are so great. I am able to wear hoops without my earlobe looking weird.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2016"},{"id":"B07BSMFXZN-19","r":5.0,"t":"They seem to be just what she was looking for! Good quality","x":"My girl can finally wear her earings again! Great for damaged ear lobes!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B07BSMFXZN-20","r":5.0,"t":"Game changer","x":"These are great! I can wear hook earrings again!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2022"},{"id":"B07BSMFXZN-21","r":1.0,"t":"and found I can hear better without it","x":"I purchased wonder ear, and found I can hear better without it. Everything I hear with it sounds harmonic, kind of like there are two people talking at the same time. Same with music, sounds harmonic. I like the idea that it plugs in, but not the idea that I can't hear properly with it. I have a pair or another brand, that is also inexpensive, that run on batteries. And they are also not very good, as they let in mostly background noise, more than voices, as does the wonder ear. It's a waist of ","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B07BSMFXZN-22","r":5.0,"t":"Great product!","x":"Works great! I have a tear in my left earlobe and with these I am able to wear any earring. I don't like to wear them multiple days in a row, but my friend does and she doesn't have a problem. I have forgotten to take them off and they are still on after I shower. Would definitely recommend!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B07BSMFXZN-23","r":5.0,"t":"They are easy to use and work wonderfully","x":"I have newly pierced ears and I find that if I wear &#34;heavy&#34; earrings my ears start to hurt after awhile. I am currently using these a preventative method and as a means of support. They are easy to use and work wonderfully!!","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Apr 2017"},{"id":"B07BSMFXZN-24","r":5.0,"t":"Great product.","x":"I haven't been able to wear any earrings for years even posts & then I stumbled across these & I can once again wear my earrings. I will keep buying these as long as they're around. Great product.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2016"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many customers with torn, stretched, or split earlobes say the product lets them wear earrings again.","cites":[1,2,5,6,10,14]},{"text":"Reviewers report the adhesive stays in place for several days, even through showers and washing.","cites":[6,9,15]},{"text":"Several customers say it works well for heavy, long, or dangling earrings and prevents drooping.","cites":[3,8,9,15]},{"text":"Some customers report it does not work for big or heavy earrings and that the adhesive moves or leaves residue.","cites":[11,12,13]},{"text":"Users describe the product as discreet and better than other brands they have tried.","cites":[4,7]}]},"qa":[]}